an style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">◆ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">kit </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">국제교류도우미란</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">금오공과대학교에서의 생활을 시작하는 외국인 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">한국어연수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학부과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교환학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">들의 생활 정착에서부터 학사 및 교내외 활동에 이르는 전반적인 부분에 대한 도움을 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">재학생과 외국인 학생간의 상호교류를 활성화시킴으로써 글로벌 리더로서의 소양을 기르고자 구성된 프로그램</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">본교에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학기 이상 수학한 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">책임감이 강하고 적극적이며 사교적인 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">봉사정신이 강하고 유학생들과의 교류를 희망하는 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">외국어 가능자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">활동사항 및 기간</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">활동기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2017. 8. 1. (화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ~ 2017. 12. 15. (</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) [2017</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">]</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">활동사항 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">외국인 학생과의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1:1 </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">혹은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1:2 </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">팀별 매칭 교류</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">유학생 입국 픽업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공항 및 버스터미널</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">후 생활관 입사 돕기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교육청 세계이해교육 활동 참가 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학교 및 구미지역 안내 캠퍼스 투어 및 수강신청을 비롯한 전반적인 학교생활에 대한 안내 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">국제교류교육원 공식 행사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family